id: DRAFT-libtsm-4.6.0-meson-pkgconf-check-count-cmake-fallback
trigger_tool: meson|conan|cmake
phase: building|testing
error_signature: Dependency lookup for check.*pkg-config.*failed|Pkg-config for machine host machine not found|CMake Error at CMakeLists\.txt.*project|System is unknown to cmake
severity: 3
category: build-system, cmake, testing, ohos
match_keywords: meson_pkgconf, check, temporary_directory_readonly
title: Meson+check库在OHOS下pkgconf供给注入与用例级计数及消费者CMake平台别名回退
root_cause: 配方仅tool_requires pkgconf/3.0.5但未将其bindir前置到PATH且未向machine文件写入pkgconfig绝对路径，真机无系统pkg-config时Meson的pkg-config探测必然失败；meson默认隐藏通过用例stdout导致Checks行缺失而回退到7套件计数冒充44用例；cmake 4.4.3无Platform/HarmonyOS模块且worker缺profile绝对编译器路径导致消费者配置失败
affected_scope: 以Meson构建且以check为test_requires经PkgConfigDeps供给check.pc、在OHOS真机无系统pkg-config环境下构建的C库，及以CMake为消费者的test_package验证
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志应显示meson configure通过check探测且HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT status passed framework meson+check discovered 44 executed 44 passed 44，test_package显示HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT通过且无System is unknown to cmake
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: pkgconf-supply-injection-plus-verbose-count-cmake-alias
rec_description: 从conan dependencies.build解析pkgconf/meson bindir并前置到meson环境PATH，同时向conan_meson_native/cross.ini注入pkgconfig绝对路径；主包meson test加-v捕获44个用例级Checks行并以无Checks行直接判失败防止套件数冒充；test_package改显式CMakeToolchain强制CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME为Linux并在profile编译器缺失时回退PATH clang
rec_command: conanfile.py: build_requirements新增tool_requires meson/1.11.0+pkgconf/3.0.5与test_requires check/0.15.2，generate()新增PkgConfigDeps+_inject_pkg_config/_meson_environment PATH前置，build()以可写TEMP/TMP/TMPDIR运行meson test -v --print-errorlogs；test_package/conanfile.py: generate()导出可写TEMP/TMP/TMPDIR并用显式CMakeToolchain置CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux加编译器回退
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: disable-upstream-tests-with-audit
fallback_description: 若check交叉编译无法供给则保留探测失败审计记录并显式关闭tests，MANIFEST声明upstream_test_in_build为false且不冒充用例数
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"discovered":7[^}]*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止以7套件数冒充44用例数放行；无Checks行时必须判失败并加-v重跑
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检evidence incomplete或审计44用例不符，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-boost-temporary-directory-readonly, DRAFT-buildtorrent-temporary-directory-readonly]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libtsm-4.6.0-meson-pkgconf-check-count-cmake-fallback.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: libtsm/4.6.0 真机预检meson pkg-config探测失败与用例计数及CMake消费者配置失败并修复通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10336
